<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy — Sudoku Brain Saga" description="Privacy Policy for Sudoku Brain Saga by Pradeept Bhanu.">
  <section style="padding:6rem 0 2rem"><div class="container"><div class="kicker">Sudoku Brain Saga</div><h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="section-copy">Last updated: August 13, 2026</p></div></section>
  <section style="padding-top:1rem"><div class="container"><div class="panel" style="padding:2rem;line-height:1.8">
    <h2>1. About this policy</h2><p>Sudoku Brain Saga is a Sudoku puzzle game developed and published by Pradeept Bhanu. This policy explains how information is handled when you use the App.</p>
    <h2>2. Information handled by the App</h2><p>The App may handle game preferences and puzzle-related data stored locally on your device. If you connect Google Play Games, the App may receive your Play Games Player ID, display name and profile information made available through the service. Google Mobile Ads may process information required for advertising, measurement and fraud prevention.</p>
    <h2>3. Google Play Games</h2><p>Play Games Services may be used for gaming authentication and related features such as achievements and leaderboards. The App does not request or store your Google account password.</p>
    <h2>4. Local game data</h2><p>Game progress, puzzle state and settings such as sound, haptic feedback, error highlighting and timer preferences may be stored locally on your device.</p>
    <h2>5. Advertising</h2><p>Sudoku Brain Saga uses Google Mobile Ads (AdMob). Depending on your location and applicable settings, advertising SDKs may process device, advertising, diagnostic, network and interaction information for advertising services, measurement and fraud prevention.</p>
    <h2>6. How information is used</h2><ul><li>Provide and maintain the game.</li><li>Save preferences and applicable game progress.</li><li>Authenticate players through Google Play Games.</li><li>Provide gaming features when enabled.</li><li>Display and measure advertising.</li><li>Diagnose technical problems and improve stability.</li></ul>
    <h2>7. Sharing and third-party services</h2><p>We do not sell your personal information. Information may be processed by Google Play Games Services and Google Mobile Ads as necessary to provide their respective services.</p>
    <h2>8. Security and retention</h2><p>We take reasonable measures to protect information handled by the App. Local game data remains on your device until it is removed by clearing application storage or uninstalling the App. Third-party service retention is governed by the applicable provider policies.</p>
    <h2>9. Children's privacy</h2><p>Sudoku Brain Saga is a general-audience puzzle game and is not specifically designed to request personal information from children.</p>
    <h2>10. Changes</h2><p>We may update this policy when the App, services, legal requirements or data practices change. The Last updated date will be changed when the policy is revised.</p>
    <h2>11. Contact</h2><p><strong>Developer:</strong> Pradeept Bhanu</p><p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://pradeeptbhanu.com/">pradeeptbhanu.com</a></p>
  </div></div></section>
</MainLayout>
